        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lahabu na badati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho balī ha Shitimu henaho, ū Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni ūtūma mu mbisīla bagosha babīlī; ūbawīla gīkī, “Jaagi mukīīdate ī sī yenīyo; ī no no no ī Yeliko.” Hūna būja būkingīla mu numba ya nkīma ūmò malahya, lina lyakwe witanagwa Lahabu; būlenda henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Yeliko ūwīlwa gīkī, “Alidegelekaga ī lelo ī būjikū bizaga ūmu bamò ba Baisilaeli kwīdata ī sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Yeliko ūtūma banhū ū kū ng'wa Lahabu alīhaya, “Bafunyage hanze a banhū abo bizaga bingīla mu ng'wako; nguno a benabo bizaga kwīdata pyī ī sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akasangwa wabasolaga a bagosha benabo būbīlī wabo ūbabisa. Na lūūlū ūshosha alīhaya gīkī, “Na ng'hana baalī bizaga bagosha babīlī a henaha, alīyo natadeebile ūko baalī baafumaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyagwa ī līīmi, lyashika ikanza lya kūlugalwa mita gwa nzengo, baalī bīnga, nūleka ū kūdeeba ūko baalī baalola. Bakūūbījagi wangū, naliganika mukūbapandīka dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Alīyo walī wabalinhya kwigūlya ya numba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Numba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī numba ja banhū benabo jalī ja matembe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yakwe hūna ūbakundīkīja mantī ga kitaani gaalī ū kwigūlya ya numba.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana abo baalī baatūng'wa būdima nzīla balībakūūbīja kūīlīīla kū mongo gwa Yolodani, būkashika ū kū būkīlīlo wa mongo gwenūyo. Aho bīnga dūhū a bakūūbīja benabo, gūlugalwa ū mita gwa nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badati benabo aho bataalī kūlaala, ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūlinha ū kwigūlya ūko baalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Ū nene namanile gīkī ū SEEBA wang'winhile bing'we ī sī yenīyī. Nīyo nī lyogohya ling'we lyatūminije no; nose pye a bikaji ba ng'wenūmu baahahūkile",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baahaahūkile no kūlwa nguno ya kūng'ogoha bing'we:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū gīkī, baabile ū kūbūtongi wing'we.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no, kūlwa nguno ya kūng'ogoha bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī mhola jing'we jatūpandīka, ī gīkī ū SEEBA akamubeegeja nzīla aho mulīfuma Misili, ūgakamya a minzī ga mu Nyanza Yaaza, ng'ūpandīka ha kūbītīla. Pyī nī mihayo ya kīya ū kū nkīlo gwa Yolodani, īyo mukabīītīla ba Sihoni na Ogi, a batemi a babīlī ba Baamooli, abo mukabakenaagūla gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho twayigwa ī yenīyo jūbbaha ī ng'holò jise, būlī ng'weene ūmala gete ū gwa kūpya kūlwa nguno ying'we; nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we hū ng'wene ūyo alī Mulungu ū kwigūlya ū ng'wigūlū, nī hasī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, nalīng'wikūmbīlīja muniilahīlīle kūlī SEEBA, gīkī mukwīyītīla yawiza ī kaya ya ng'wise, nguno nū nene nang'wītīlaga yawiza. Hama nīyo ninhagi shimanīīkījo sha ng'hana gete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sha koolecha gīkī mutūmūlaga ū baba nū mayū, na a baana bang'wise bagosha na bakīma, na a banhū ba mu kaya jabo pye a bose; na gīkī mukūtūpīja ū būpanga wise, tūtizūūcha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo būng'wīla gīkī, “Twaweega ū būpanga wise kūlwa būpanga wing'we! Ūlū ng'ūleka ū kūgūkumūcha ū nīmo gwise gwenūyū, a bise tūkūng'wītīla yawiza na ya wishigwa būtaale no ī likanza lya ng'wa SEEBA kūtwinha ī sī yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūbabītīja h'iddilisha, ūbicha bo lūgoye, nguno ī numba īyo wikalaga, ī ndugu ya lwandī ū lūmò yaalī ndugu ya nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla gīkī, “Jaagi kū ngūlū, batizūmupandīka abo balīmukooba; jagi mukibise kwenūko shikū idatū kūshisha bashoke, hanuma lūūlū hū mukūja ūko ng'wafumile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo būng'wīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, “A bise tūtūbiza na shilingo ū mu shilahīlo īsho watwilahīja shenīshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlū gīkī a h'ikanza lya kwingīla ū mu sī yenīyī tūūleka kūsanga wagūtungaga ū ngwasho gwaza ūyū, a h'idilisha īlo watwikīja lyenīlī; na a babyaaji bako, ū so nū noko, ūsangwe wabingījaga ū mu numba yako, hamò na a baana ba ng'wing'we bagosha na bakīma, nī kaya ya ng'wing'we ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūfuma ū mu numba yenīyī ūja hanze kūcheyeeka mu mabbalabbala, a mininga gakwe gakūbiza higūlya ya ntwe gwakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; a bise tūtūbiza ba kūsolwa būbi. Alīyo ūlū munhū alī mu kaya hamò nang'ho, hūna nkono gose gose gūnkuumya, a mininga gakwe gakūbiza ha mitwe yise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū bebe ūlū ūlagūkumūche ū nīmo gwise gwenūyū, tūkūbiza twataligūka ū mu shilahīlo īsho watwilahījaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Mulītūngīlīja n'ījaaage gīt'ūmo ng'wahayīla gīko.” Hūna ūbaleka būja; nang'hwe ūgūtunga ū ngwasho gwaza a h'idilisha lyenīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshoka kwa badati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bīnga a henaho būlinha kūja kū ngūlū, būkikala kwenūko kūshisha shikū idatū; a bakūūbīja babo būkooba pye a hose ū mu bbihī bbihī ya nzīla, būbagayiwa būshoka kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nabo a bagosha a babīlī benabo bika ū mu ngūlū būshoka, būūkakīla a ha būkīlīlo wa mongo, būja ū kūlī Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni, būūkang'winha pyī īyo īkabilongela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Ū SEEBA wītūūlile mu makono gise gete pyī ī sī yenīyo, a ba nhū a bose ūmo bagelelile bakūdetemaga dūhū ī haha kūlwa kūtogoha bise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
